WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.840
I'm Russ Michaels with Tercet Law.

2
00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:12.700
Your estate plan probably covers your house, your accounts, and your kids,

3
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.580
but there's something new to protect now.

4
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:22.820
Your digital life, your email, your photos, and more and more, an AI assistant

5
00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:27.860
that knows your schedule, your money, your voice, and the way you think.

6
00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:33.500
Soon, most of us will have one working for us every single day.

7
00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:38.920
So ask yourself, if you couldn't speak for yourself tomorrow, who would

8
00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.260
be allowed to reach it?

9
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.160
What happens to everything it remembers?

10
00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:45.900
And would it keep acting in your name?

11
00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:51.500
Texas law already lets you name the person who can reach your digital accounts.

12
00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:57.200
A modern plan does that in your will and your power of attorney, and it

13
00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:01.840
lines up the settings inside your apps because those settings can override

14
00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:02.400
your will.

15
00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:07.880
Then it says what happens next, who takes the keys, what's kept for your

16
00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:13.960
family, what's deleted, and what should never be made from your voice or

17
00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:14.520
your face.

18
00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:21.020
Add a short values file so the people in the tools you leave behind know

19
00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:26.360
what you stood for, and a family code word so if someone ever calls your

20
00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:31.060
mother in your cloned voice asking for money, she'll know it isn't you.

21
00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:36.940
Then look at it once a year together, because this part of life changes

22
00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:37.440
fast.

23
00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:39.940
There's a door here for you.

24
00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:45.540
Click the link below and let's build an estate plan for the age we actually

25
00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:46.060
live in.

